   "id": "SQ-EXACT",
   "assumption": "start == 1",
   "guarantee": "out * out <= in && (out + 1) * (out + 1) > in",
   "why_not_minable": "same operand-invisibility problem, plus ten Newton iterations do not converge for large operands, so the exactness contract is not even true of the RTL",
